<metadata><name>Day 9 (stop 2 of 3) - Adam Dopko, Cline Mountain Road</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.194798" lon="-79.598206"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside Parking: At the intersection of the Adam Dopko Access Trail and Main St W at…. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.196030" lon="-79.623520"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Roadside Parking: At the end of Cline Mountain Rd, 1 km south of its intersection with Main St…. Free. Joins the route near km 2.9 (0 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.193883" lon="-79.617661"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off behind you.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.193726" lon="-79.624815"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Cline Mountain Road Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.) This is a short excursion (about 630 m in all): walk the whole Cline Mountain Road Side Trail, including the short loop or branch near its end (see the map), and come back to this junction.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
